<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <!-- ABOUT HERO -->
    <section class="section section-dark about-hero">
      <div class="hero-bg-glow"></div>

      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
          <div class="col-lg-7">

            <h1 class="hero-title animate-up delay-1">
              Building the <span>intelligence layer</span> for modern energy trading.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-subtitle animate-up delay-2">
              TraWis helps Oil &amp; Gas operators bring pricing, risk, logistics,
              market signals, and enterprise data into one AI-powered decision layer.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions animate-up delay-3">
              <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">Schedule Demo</a>
              <a href="/leadership" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Meet Leadership</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="about-hero-visual animate-up delay-2">
              <img
                src="/assets/about-hero.png"
                alt="Trade intelligence"
                class="about-hero-img"
              >

              <div class="about-hero-card">
                <span>Purpose-built for</span>
                <strong>Oil &amp; Gas Operators</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHO WE ARE -->
    <section class="section section-soft">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
          <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="section-kicker">Who we are</div>

            <h2 class="section-title">
              An AI-first platform company focused on trade desk transformation.
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-7">
            <p class="section-text">
              TraWis was created to solve one of the most complex challenges in energy trading:
              helping trade desk teams make faster, more accurate, and more explainable decisions
              across pricing, exposure, logistics, and risk.
            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
              Most operators already have powerful systems for execution, accounting,
              risk reporting, and enterprise operations. But the decision-making layer often
              remains fragmented across spreadsheets, disconnected dashboards, market feeds,
              and manual analysis.
            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
              TraWis sits above existing systems like ETRM, CTRM, ERP, logistics, contracts,
              and market data platforms to create a unified intelligence layer for the trading function.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- MISSION -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <div class="section-kicker">Our mission</div>

          <h2 class="section-title">
            Turn trading complexity into confident action.
          </h2>

          <p class="section-text mx-auto">
            We believe traders, pricers, schedulers, and risk managers should not have to
            chase signals across systems. They should have one trusted layer that brings
            the right data, recommendations, and reasoning together.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">1</div>
              <h3>Unify signals</h3>
              <p>
                Bring internal operator data and external market signals into one connected decision view.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">2</div>
              <h3>Predict earlier</h3>
              <p>
                Use AI and ML models to identify pricing patterns, volatility signals, and market shifts.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">3</div>
              <h3>Recommend action</h3>
              <p>
                Support buy, sell, hedge, pricing, scheduling, and risk actions with explainable recommendations.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">4</div>
              <h3>Govern decisions</h3>
              <p>
                Provide workflow-based approvals, audit trails, and controls for enterprise adoption.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHY TRAWis EXISTS -->
    <section class="section section-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="section-kicker">Why we exist</div>

            <h2 class="section-title text-white">
              Energy trading has too much data, but not enough decision intelligence.
            </h2>

            <p class="section-text text-white-70">
              Trading teams are expected to act quickly in a market shaped by price volatility,
              supply disruptions, geopolitical events, weather, logistics constraints, and
              constantly changing risk exposure.
            </p>

            <p class="section-text text-white-70">
              TraWis exists to reduce that complexity by turning fragmented data into
              predictive, explainable, and role-based recommendations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="about-image-stack">
              <img
                src="https://placehold.co/720x460/4d2f63/ffffff?text=Market+Signals"
                alt="Market signals placeholder"
                class="about-stack-img about-stack-img-main"
              >

              <img
                src="https://placehold.co/420x280/ffc400/191620?text=Risk+View"
                alt="Risk view placeholder"
                class="about-stack-img about-stack-img-small"
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT -->
    <section class="section section-soft">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <div class="section-kicker">What makes us different</div>

          <h2 class="section-title">
            Built for the realities of enterprise trading.
          </h2>

          <p class="section-text mx-auto">
            TraWis is not just a dashboard or chatbot. It is designed as a governed,
            integrated, and explainable intelligence platform for enterprise operators.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="feature-card about-difference-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">01</div>
              <h3>Domain-first design</h3>
              <p>
                Built around real trading desk personas including traders, pricers,
                schedulers, risk managers, and commercial teams.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="feature-card about-difference-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">02</div>
              <h3>System-aware intelligence</h3>
              <p>
                Designed to connect with existing ETRM, CTRM, ERP, logistics,
                contract, and market data environments.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="col-lg-4">
            <article class="feature-card about-difference-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">03</div>
              <h3>Explainable recommendations</h3>
              <p>
                Recommendations are supported by confidence scores, reasoning,
                governance, and auditability.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- IMPACT BAND -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <div class="section-kicker">Designed for impact</div>

          <h2 class="section-title">
            Helping trading teams move faster with better control.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="impact-grid">
          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong>40–50</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Faster decision cycles</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong>2–3</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Margin improvement via early signal detection</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong>20–40</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Reduction in exposure risk</p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <strong>25</strong>
            <span>%</span>
            <p>Fewer manual tasks through automation</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


<!-- ENTERPRISE READINESS -->
<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <img
          src="https://placehold.co/620x480/191620/ffc400?text=Enterprise+Ready"
          alt="Enterprise-ready trade intelligence platform"
          class="about-platform-img"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="section-kicker">Enterprise ready</div>

        <h2 class="section-title">
          Built for complex operator environments.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-text">
          TraWis is designed for enterprise trading teams that need more than a dashboard.
          The platform brings together secure integration, workflow governance,
          explainable recommendations, and audit-ready decision trails.
        </p>

        <p class="section-text">
          From predictive pricing to risk visibility and role-based recommendations,
          TraWis helps operators start with focused use cases and scale across the
          trading function over time.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/leadership" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">Meet Leadership</a>
          <a href="/platform" class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg">Explore Platform</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="section demo-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-card">
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker">Ready to learn more?</div>

            <h2>See how TraWis can support your trading function.</h2>

            <p>
              Schedule a conversation to explore product vision, pilot opportunities,
              enterprise architecture, and use cases for your trade desk.
            </p>
            <br>
            <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-brand btn-lg">
            Schedule Demo
          </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>